  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "A forest plot of test sensitivity (%) in four head-to-head studies (Ruhwald 2017, Aggerbeck 2018, Aggerbeck 2019, Hoff 2016), with random-effects pooled estimates: TST 15mm 77.18% (66.44–85.25), TST 5mm 82.68% (74.91–88.42), TST 5mm HIV+/15mm HIV− 78.18% (67.75–85.94), IGRA 71.67% (63.44–78.68) and C-Tb 74.52% (70.39–78.25). Heterogeneity is high for TST 15mm (I² = 81%), TST 5mm/15mm (84%) and IGRA (78%) and 0% for C-Tb.",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
    },
    {
      "text": "مخطط شجري لحساسية الاختبارات (%) في أربع دراسات للمقارنة المباشرة (Ruhwald 2017 وAggerbeck 2018 وAggerbeck 2019 وHoff 2016)، مع تقديرات مجمّعة بنموذج التأثيرات العشوائية: TST 15 مم 77.18% (66.44–85.25)، وTST 5 مم 82.68% (74.91–88.42)، وTST 5 مم لمن لديهم فيروس العوز المناعي البشري/15 مم لمن ليس لديهم 78.18% (67.75–85.94)، وIGRA 71.67% (63.44–78.68)، وC-Tb 74.52% (70.39–78.25). وعدم التجانس مرتفع في TST 15 مم (I² = 81%) وTST 5/15 مم (84%) وIGRA (78%)، ويبلغ 0% في C-Tb.",
      "lang": "ar",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
    },
    {
      "text": "森林图显示四项头对头研究（Ruhwald 2017、Aggerbeck 2018、Aggerbeck 2019、Hoff 2016）中的检测灵敏度（%），以及随机效应合并估计值：TST 15mm 77.18%（66.44–85.25），TST 5mm 82.68%（74.91–88.42），TST 5mm（艾滋病毒阳性）/15mm（艾滋病毒阴性）78.18%（67.75–85.94），IGRA 71.67%（63.44–78.68），C-Tb 74.52%（70.39–78.25）。TST 15mm（I² = 81%）、TST 5mm/15mm（84%）和IGRA（78%）的异质性较高，C-Tb为0%。",
      "lang": "zh",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
    },
    {
      "text": "Diagrama de bosque de la sensibilidad (%) en cuatro estudios de comparación directa (Ruhwald 2017, Aggerbeck 2018, Aggerbeck 2019, Hoff 2016), con estimaciones combinadas por modelo de efectos aleatorios: TST 15 mm 77,18% (66,44–85,25), TST 5 mm 82,68% (74,91–88,42), TST 5 mm VIH+/15 mm VIH− 78,18% (67,75–85,94), IGRA 71,67% (63,44–78,68) y C-Tb 74,52% (70,39–78,25). La heterogeneidad es alta para TST 15 mm (I² = 81%), TST 5/15 mm (84%) e IGRA (78%), y del 0% para C-Tb.",
      "lang": "es",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
    },
    {
      "text": "Graphique en forêt de la sensibilité (%) dans quatre études de comparaison directe (Ruhwald 2017, Aggerbeck 2018, Aggerbeck 2019, Hoff 2016), avec les estimations groupées par modèle à effets aléatoires : TST 15 mm 77,18 % (66,44–85,25), TST 5 mm 82,68 % (74,91–88,42), TST 5 mm VIH+/15 mm VIH− 78,18 % (67,75–85,94), IGRA 71,67 % (63,44–78,68) et C-Tb 74,52 % (70,39–78,25). L’hétérogénéité est élevée pour TST 15 mm (I² = 81 %), TST 5/15 mm (84 %) et IGRA (78 %), et de 0 % pour C-Tb.",
      "lang": "fr",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
    },
    {
      "text": "Лесовидный график чувствительности (%) в четырёх исследованиях прямого сравнения (Ruhwald 2017, Aggerbeck 2018, Aggerbeck 2019, Hoff 2016) с объединёнными оценками по модели случайных эффектов: TST 15 мм — 77,18% (66,44–85,25), TST 5 мм — 82,68% (74,91–88,42), TST 5 мм при ВИЧ+/15 мм при ВИЧ− — 78,18% (67,75–85,94), IGRA — 71,67% (63,44–78,68), C-Tb — 74,52% (70,39–78,25). Гетерогенность высокая для TST 15 мм (I² = 81%), TST 5/15 мм (84%) и IGRA (78%), для C-Tb — 0%.",
